# This PUBLIC repository stores scripts and documentation ONLY.
# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow code / command / doc files.
# Never force-add data, metadata tables, allele tables, trees, cell states, h5ad/RDS/loom, figures.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.R
!*.sh
!*.sbatch
!*.md
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!logs/.gitkeep
# conda environment specs (software versions only, no data)
!envs/*.json
